<view
  wx:if="{{visible}}"
  class="phone-sheet-mask"
  bindtap="onClose"
  catchtouchmove="onPanelTap"
>
  <view class="phone-sheet" catchtap="onPanelTap">
    <view class="sheet-handle"></view>
    <view class="sheet-head">
      <view class="sheet-icon">
        <t-icon name="mobile-vibrate" size="52rpx" color="#0b6b3a" />
      </view>
      <view class="sheet-title">验证手机号</view>
      <view class="sheet-close" bindtap="onClose">×</view>
    </view>
    <view class="sheet-copy">
      你可以先浏览小程序。手机号仅在你主动同意后由微信提供，用于当前机构身份核验和后续服务。
    </view>
    <button
      class="phone-grant-button"
      open-type="getPhoneNumber"
      loading="{{submitting}}"
      disabled="{{submitting}}"
      bindgetphonenumber="onGetPhoneNumber"
    >{{submitting ? '正在验证…' : '微信授权手机号'}}</button>
    <view class="sheet-skip" bindtap="onClose">暂不授权</view>
    <view class="sheet-footnote">服务端仅返回脱敏号码，不接收手工输入</view>
  </view>
</view>
